<p>A mighty kick that pushes your target away <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> grids.</p><p>If another creature is in the way, it will also be pushed away.</p><p>The Knockback chance increases with your Accuracy or your Physical Power, whichever is greater.</p>